menu "CC1101 radio"

config CC1101_OOK_CLOSE_RANGE_BENCH
    bool "Low-power OOK for close-range bench testing"
    default n
    help
        Use PATABLE {0x00, 0x12} for OOK at 433.92 MHz: nominal -30 dBm
        conducted according to TI's 433 MHz PA table, not measured power.
        This is an explicit close-range test option, not automatic power
        adaptation and not a guarantee at any antenna distance.
        The normal C8 ceiling and other modulation profiles remain unchanged.
        No automatic transmissions or retries are enabled.

config CC1101_ALL_PROFILES_CLOSE_RANGE_BENCH
    bool "Low-power PA for all profiles in close-range bench testing"
    default n
    help
        Use TI's nominal 433 MHz low-power PA levels for every profile:
        OOK {0x00, 0x12}, ASK {0x12, 0x34}, 2-FSK/GFSK {0x12, 0x00}.
        These are nominal conducted register values, not measured power.
        This option overrides the OOK-only bench option and is intended only
        for short bench links. The default build keeps OOK {0x00, 0xC8},
        ASK {0x34, 0xC8}, and 2-FSK/GFSK {0xC8, 0x00}. No automatic
        transmissions or retries are enabled.

endmenu
